	"hardwareControls": [
		"25 keys",
		"Pitch bend wheel",
		"Modulation wheel",
		"Pedal input"
	],
	"notice": "Connect via USB and select the keyboard MIDI input and matching MIDI channel in your application. This profile covers keyboard performance messages only. CC1 and CC64 represent standard modulation and sustain assignments; match any hardware reassignment using MIDI learn. Assignable controls, DAW transport and software integration are not mapped here. Port names vary by operating system and are intentionally omitted until verified on hardware; select this profile manually. The panel is a schematic, not a scaled hardware drawing. Virtual note numbers are illustrative; use MIDI learn after changing octave or transpose.",
